What is a key performance consideration when using ai.text.embed() to create embeddings for multiple nodes?

// Inefficient: One API call per movie
MATCH (m:Movie) LIMIT 100
WITH m, ai.text.embed(m.plot, 'OpenAI', $config) AS vector
SET m.embedding = vector

// Efficient: One API call for batch
MATCH (m:Movie) LIMIT 100
WITH collect(m) AS movies, [m IN collect(m) | m.plot] AS batch
CALL ai.text.embedBatch(batch, 'OpenAI', $config) YIELD index, vector
// Process results...
